# DAY 14 — Final System Validation & Testing

## Objective

The objective of Day 14 is to perform final validation of the complete
Real-Time Electric Vehicle Dashboard and ADAS Warning System.

The complete system integrates:

- EV Control
- Drive Modes
- Motor Temperature Monitoring
- Battery SOC Monitoring
- Ultrasonic Sensors
- Forward Collision Warning
- Blind Spot Detection
- Time To Collision (TTC)
- Fault Management
- State Machine
- UART Command Shell
- Python EV ADAS Dashboard

---

## 1. Complete System Flow

The overall system operates in the following sequence:

```text
Sensors / User Inputs
        ↓
ADC / Ultrasonic / UART
        ↓
EV Control Module
        ↓
ADAS Module
        ↓
Fault Management
        ↓
State Machine
        ↓
PWM / Motor Control
        ↓
UART Telemetry
        ↓
Python Dashboard
